+  `R_pi=2A+F=4S+11F-2sum E_i`. These recover
+  `L^2=-1`, `S^2=T^2=-2`, `L.S=L.T=1`, `S.T=2`, and
+  `R_pi.(L,S,T)=(2,3,3)`.
